WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.453
Hi, I'm Abderrahman.

00:00:00.509 --> 00:00:01.585
Welcome to Kotlin Programming with IntelliJ IDEA,

00:00:01.887 --> 00:00:04.988
where you'll write concise,

00:00:05.135 --> 00:00:07.849
